{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14399","headline":"南野 · 戴叔伦","name":"南野","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"治田长山下，引流坦溪曲。\n东山有遗茔，南野起新筑。\n家世素业儒，子孙鄙食禄。\n披云朝出畊，带月夜归读。\n身勩竟亡疲，团团欣在目。\n野芳绿可采，泉美清可掬。\n茂树延晚凉，早田候秋熟。\n茶烹松火红，酒吸荷杯绿。\n解佩临清池，抚琴看修竹。\n此怀谁与同，此乐君所独。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"戴叔伦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14399.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14399","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}